#* {{quote-book|en|author=Chuck White|title=Developing Killer Web Apps with Dreamweaver MX and C#|publisher=[[w:Wiley (publisher)|Wiley]]|year=2006|month=February|page=269|pageurl=https://www.google.com.sv/books/edition/Developing_Killer_Web_Apps_with_Dreamwea/QP6aKq0r6CYC?hl=en&gbpv=1&dq=%22matches+any%22&pg=PA269&printsec=frontcover|text=[a-z]: A range of characters that matches '''any''' character in the specified range. For example, [a-z] matches '''any''' lowercase alphabetic character in the range a through z.}}
